# Neo Poly parameters (docs/specs/machines.md §5). The order is permanent: songs and presets
# store values by position. Regenerate: python3 tools/gen-machine-params.py Machines/NeoPoly
namespace NeoBuzz.Poly
class NeoPolyMachine
tracks 16
summary Virtual analog polysynth: three oscillators, two filters (ladder and SVF), amp, filter and mod envelopes, two LFOs and a mod matrix. Use it for pads, basses, leads, plucks, brass and keys.

group Voice
VoiceMode   "Voice mode"    0 2    0    enum Poly Mono Legato           | Poly; Mono retriggers; Legato glides without retriggering
Polyphony   "Polyphony"     1 16   8    int 0                           | Notes that sound at once
Unison      "Unison"        1 7    1    int 0                           | Voices per note
UniDetune   "Uni detune"    0 1000 200  pct                             | Detune between unison voices (up to ±50 cents)
UniSpread   "Uni spread"    0 1000 600  pct                             | Stereo spread of unison voices
GlideMode   "Glide mode"    0 2    0    enum Off Always Legato          | When notes glide
Glide       "Glide"         0 1000 200  pow 0 2 3 s 3                   | Glide time
BendRange   "Bend range"    0 24   2    int 0 st                        | Pitch bend range
Drift       "Drift"         0 1000 150  pct                             | Analog drift of pitch and cutoff per voice
Volume      "Volume"        0 1000 739  db -40 6 inf                    | Output level
VelAmp      "Vel → amp"     0 1000 700  pct                             | How much velocity changes loudness

group Osc 1
O1Shape     "O1 shape"      0 1000 667  lin 0 3 "" 2                    | Sine → triangle → saw → pulse
O1PW        "O1 PW"         0 1000 500  lin 2 98 % 0                    | Pulse width
O1Oct       "O1 octave"     0 6    3    int -3 oct signed               | Octave
O1Semi      "O1 semi"       0 24   12   int -12 st signed               | Semitones
O1Fine      "O1 fine"       0 1000 500  lin -50 50 ct 0                 | Fine tune
O1Level     "O1 level"      0 1000 1000 pct                             | Level into the filter

group Osc 2
O2Shape     "O2 shape"      0 1000 667  lin 0 3 "" 2                    | Sine → triangle → saw → pulse
O2PW        "O2 PW"         0 1000 500  lin 2 98 % 0                    | Pulse width
O2Oct       "O2 octave"     0 6    3    int -3 oct signed               | Octave
O2Semi      "O2 semi"       0 24   12   int -12 st signed               | Semitones
O2Fine      "O2 fine"       0 1000 540  lin -50 50 ct 0                 | Fine tune
O2Level     "O2 level"      0 1000 0    pct                             | Level into the filter
O2Sync      "O2 sync"       0 1    0    switch                          | Hard-sync to oscillator 1
O2Fm        "FM 1 → 2"      0 1000 0    pow 0 4 2 "" 2                  | Linear (through-zero) FM of oscillator 2 by oscillator 1

group Osc 3
O3Shape     "O3 shape"      0 1000 0    lin 0 3 "" 2                    | Sine → triangle → saw → pulse
O3Oct       "O3 octave"     0 6    2    int -3 oct signed               | Octave (a sub oscillator by default)
O3Semi      "O3 semi"       0 24   12   int -12 st signed               | Semitones
O3Fine      "O3 fine"       0 1000 500  lin -50 50 ct 0                 | Fine tune
O3Level     "O3 level"      0 1000 0    pct                             | Level into the filter
group Mixer
RingLevel   "Ring 1×2"      0 1000 0    pct                             | Ring modulation of oscillators 1 and 2
NoiseLevel  "Noise"         0 1000 0    pct                             | Noise level
NoiseColor  "Noise colour"  0 1000 0    pct                             | White → pink

group Filter 1
F1Type      "F1 type"       0 5    0    enum Ladder_24 Ladder_12 SVF_LP SVF_BP SVF_HP SVF_Notch | Filter 1 model
F1Cutoff    "F1 cutoff"     0 1000 700  freq 20 20000                   | Cutoff
F1Reso      "F1 reso"       0 1000 150  pct                             | Resonance (the ladder self-oscillates at the top)
F1Drive     "F1 drive"      0 1000 0    lin 0 24 dB 1                   | Drive into the filter
F1Env       "F1 env"        0 1000 650  bip                             | Filter envelope amount (±6 octaves)
F1Key       "F1 key track"  0 1000 500  pct                             | Cutoff follows the keyboard (100 %: one octave per octave)
F1Vel       "F1 velocity"   0 1000 300  pct                             | Softer notes close the filter (up to 3 octaves at the lowest velocity)
group Filter 2
F2Type      "F2 type"       0 4    0    enum Off LP BP HP Notch         | Filter 2 (SVF)
F2Cutoff    "F2 cutoff"     0 1000 800  freq 20 20000                   | Cutoff
F2Reso      "F2 reso"       0 1000 100  pct                             | Resonance
F2Env       "F2 env"        0 1000 500  bip                             | Filter envelope amount (±6 octaves)
Routing     "Routing"       0 1    0    enum Serial Parallel            | Filter 2 after filter 1, or beside it

group Amp env
AmpA        "Amp attack"    0 1000 100  time 0.0005 20                  | Attack time
AmpD        "Amp decay"     0 1000 500  time 0.0005 20                  | Decay time (to −60 dB of the way to sustain)
AmpS        "Amp sustain"   0 1000 800  pct                             | Sustain level
AmpR        "Amp release"   0 1000 450  time 0.0005 20                  | Release time (to −60 dB)
group Filter env
FltA        "Flt attack"    0 1000 100  time 0.0005 20                  | Attack time
FltD        "Flt decay"     0 1000 520  time 0.0005 20                  | Decay time
FltS        "Flt sustain"   0 1000 300  pct                             | Sustain level
FltR        "Flt release"   0 1000 450  time 0.0005 20                  | Release time
group Mod env
ModA        "Mod attack"    0 1000 300  time 0.0005 20                  | Attack time
ModD        "Mod decay"     0 1000 600  time 0.0005 20                  | Decay time
ModS        "Mod sustain"   0 1000 0    pct                             | Sustain level
ModR        "Mod release"   0 1000 500  time 0.0005 20                  | Release time

group LFO 1
L1Shape     "LFO1 shape"    0 6    0    enum Sine Triangle Saw_up Saw_down Square S&H Smooth | Waveform
L1Rate      "LFO1 rate"     0 1000 500  freq 0.02 50                    | Rate (free)
L1Sync      "LFO1 sync"     0 11   0    enum Free 1/32 1/16T 1/16 1/8T 1/8 1/4T 1/4 1/2 1_bar 2_bars 4_bars | Tempo sync (overrides the rate)
L1Retrig    "LFO1 retrig"   0 1    1    switch                          | Restart with each note (per voice); off: one free LFO
L1Fade      "LFO1 fade"     0 1000 0    pow 0 5 2 s 2                   | Fade-in time after the note starts
group LFO 2
L2Shape     "LFO2 shape"    0 6    1    enum Sine Triangle Saw_up Saw_down Square S&H Smooth | Waveform
L2Rate      "LFO2 rate"     0 1000 300  freq 0.02 50                    | Rate (free)
L2Sync      "LFO2 sync"     0 11   0    enum Free 1/32 1/16T 1/16 1/8T 1/8 1/4T 1/4 1/2 1_bar 2_bars 4_bars | Tempo sync (overrides the rate)
L2Retrig    "LFO2 retrig"   0 1    0    switch                          | Restart with each note (per voice); off: one free LFO
L2Fade      "LFO2 fade"     0 1000 0    pow 0 5 2 s 2                   | Fade-in time after the note starts

group Matrix
M1Src "M1 source" 0 11 1 enum Off LFO_1 LFO_2 Mod_env Filter_env Amp_env Velocity Key Mod_wheel Aftertouch Random Unison | Modulation source
M1Dst "M1 dest"   0 23 0 enum Off Pitch Osc_1_pitch Osc_2_pitch Osc_3_pitch Osc_1_shape Osc_2_shape Osc_3_shape Osc_1_PW Osc_2_PW FM_amount Osc_1_level Osc_2_level Osc_3_level Noise_level Ring_level F1_cutoff F1_reso F2_cutoff F2_reso Amp Pan LFO_1_rate LFO_2_rate | Modulation destination
M1Amt "M1 amount" 0 1000 500 bip | Amount
M2Src "M2 source" 0 11 8 enum Off LFO_1 LFO_2 Mod_env Filter_env Amp_env Velocity Key Mod_wheel Aftertouch Random Unison | Modulation source
M2Dst "M2 dest"   0 23 0 enum Off Pitch Osc_1_pitch Osc_2_pitch Osc_3_pitch Osc_1_shape Osc_2_shape Osc_3_shape Osc_1_PW Osc_2_PW FM_amount Osc_1_level Osc_2_level Osc_3_level Noise_level Ring_level F1_cutoff F1_reso F2_cutoff F2_reso Amp Pan LFO_1_rate LFO_2_rate | Modulation destination
M2Amt "M2 amount" 0 1000 500 bip | Amount
M3Src "M3 source" 0 11 3 enum Off LFO_1 LFO_2 Mod_env Filter_env Amp_env Velocity Key Mod_wheel Aftertouch Random Unison | Modulation source
M3Dst "M3 dest"   0 23 0 enum Off Pitch Osc_1_pitch Osc_2_pitch Osc_3_pitch Osc_1_shape Osc_2_shape Osc_3_shape Osc_1_PW Osc_2_PW FM_amount Osc_1_level Osc_2_level Osc_3_level Noise_level Ring_level F1_cutoff F1_reso F2_cutoff F2_reso Amp Pan LFO_1_rate LFO_2_rate | Modulation destination
M3Amt "M3 amount" 0 1000 500 bip | Amount
M4Src "M4 source" 0 11 2 enum Off LFO_1 LFO_2 Mod_env Filter_env Amp_env Velocity Key Mod_wheel Aftertouch Random Unison | Modulation source
M4Dst "M4 dest"   0 23 0 enum Off Pitch Osc_1_pitch Osc_2_pitch Osc_3_pitch Osc_1_shape Osc_2_shape Osc_3_shape Osc_1_PW Osc_2_PW FM_amount Osc_1_level Osc_2_level Osc_3_level Noise_level Ring_level F1_cutoff F1_reso F2_cutoff F2_reso Amp Pan LFO_1_rate LFO_2_rate | Modulation destination
M4Amt "M4 amount" 0 1000 500 bip | Amount
M5Src "M5 source" 0 11 0 enum Off LFO_1 LFO_2 Mod_env Filter_env Amp_env Velocity Key Mod_wheel Aftertouch Random Unison | Modulation source
M5Dst "M5 dest"   0 23 0 enum Off Pitch Osc_1_pitch Osc_2_pitch Osc_3_pitch Osc_1_shape Osc_2_shape Osc_3_shape Osc_1_PW Osc_2_PW FM_amount Osc_1_level Osc_2_level Osc_3_level Noise_level Ring_level F1_cutoff F1_reso F2_cutoff F2_reso Amp Pan LFO_1_rate LFO_2_rate | Modulation destination
M5Amt "M5 amount" 0 1000 500 bip | Amount
M6Src "M6 source" 0 11 0 enum Off LFO_1 LFO_2 Mod_env Filter_env Amp_env Velocity Key Mod_wheel Aftertouch Random Unison | Modulation source
M6Dst "M6 dest"   0 23 0 enum Off Pitch Osc_1_pitch Osc_2_pitch Osc_3_pitch Osc_1_shape Osc_2_shape Osc_3_shape Osc_1_PW Osc_2_PW FM_amount Osc_1_level Osc_2_level Osc_3_level Noise_level Ring_level F1_cutoff F1_reso F2_cutoff F2_reso Amp Pan LFO_1_rate LFO_2_rate | Modulation destination
M6Amt "M6 amount" 0 1000 500 bip | Amount
M7Src "M7 source" 0 11 0 enum Off LFO_1 LFO_2 Mod_env Filter_env Amp_env Velocity Key Mod_wheel Aftertouch Random Unison | Modulation source
M7Dst "M7 dest"   0 23 0 enum Off Pitch Osc_1_pitch Osc_2_pitch Osc_3_pitch Osc_1_shape Osc_2_shape Osc_3_shape Osc_1_PW Osc_2_PW FM_amount Osc_1_level Osc_2_level Osc_3_level Noise_level Ring_level F1_cutoff F1_reso F2_cutoff F2_reso Amp Pan LFO_1_rate LFO_2_rate | Modulation destination
M7Amt "M7 amount" 0 1000 500 bip | Amount
M8Src "M8 source" 0 11 0 enum Off LFO_1 LFO_2 Mod_env Filter_env Amp_env Velocity Key Mod_wheel Aftertouch Random Unison | Modulation source
M8Dst "M8 dest"   0 23 0 enum Off Pitch Osc_1_pitch Osc_2_pitch Osc_3_pitch Osc_1_shape Osc_2_shape Osc_3_shape Osc_1_PW Osc_2_PW FM_amount Osc_1_level Osc_2_level Osc_3_level Noise_level Ring_level F1_cutoff F1_reso F2_cutoff F2_reso Amp Pan LFO_1_rate LFO_2_rate | Modulation destination
M8Amt "M8 amount" 0 1000 500 bip | Amount
